+  THE RULING, verbatim, in-thread: **"add the seed row"** — in answer to the recommendation on
+  #53 to apply `4767 -> 1544` with mode `reattribute_if_cohabiting`, NOT `alias`.
+
+  WHAT WAS PUT TO THE CPO BEFORE THE ANSWER, so the ruling is on evidence and not on the
+  builder's inference. The prod nightly of 2026-08-11 failed:
+  `assert_event_team_in_fixture_participants` returned 10 rows, `dbt build` halted, and 540 of
+  970 nodes SKIPped — so ingestion kept succeeding while `dbt_analytics` went stale, and it
+  recurs every night until fixed. All 10 events sit in two WCQAS fixtures (1100381, 1100382,
+  the same two nations home and away) and every one names team 4767.
+
+  THE EXTERNAL GROUND TRUTH, which this repo's standing rule requires before asserting that two
+  entity records relate (`feedback_verify_real_world_identity`): **Mação is a municipality in
+  Portugal; Macau is an AFC member association.** A Portuguese municipality cannot appear in the
+  Asian section of World Cup qualifying. Both facts are externally checkable and were stated to
+  the CPO on #53 before the ruling.
